# Gemini 3.1 Flash — findings by GPT 6 Astra

## Model card

The exact unsuffixed model identity `gemini-3.1-flash` could not be verified. Google's official catalog lists Gemini 3 Flash, Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite, Gemini 3.1 Flash Image, and Gemini 3.1 Flash Audio as distinct entries, but no general-purpose Gemini 3.1 Flash card. [Official model-card catalog](https://deepmind.google/models/model-cards/).

The documented `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` is a specific lightweight model, not evidence that the unsuffixed folder is its alias. [Flash-Lite documentation](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite). Image and audio variants also have their own IDs and capabilities. No publisher-confirmed alias mapping for this folder was found.

Therefore release, endpoint, context, output limit, modalities, architecture, cutoff and pricing remain unassigned for this exact identity. No neighboring model's specifications are substituted.

### Raw benchmarks found

Fresh exact-name and official-domain searches returned neighboring variants rather than a verifiable benchmark row for the unsuffixed model. No verified public score found for exact-ID tool use, reasoning, coding, multimodal evaluation or long-context retrieval.

